{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"De-hardcoded census numbers across all four children per operator direction: ACs now reference LIVE code checks against current origin/main rather than fixed counts. c9f7 (53->live C901 census; ruff 0.15.19->0.16.1 pin), d9f5 (24->live warn_unused_ignores; single-diagnostic->live redundant-cast set), 28cd (three DTZ->live ASYNC/DTZ set), 125d (142->live narrow RUF census; ruff pin updated). Authoring-time figures retained only as clearly-labelled dated observations. This aligns every child with the green-on-origin-main AC. Re-running plan reviews (edits stale prior attestations; parent epic re-stales because it pins children material)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785954249002324001,"uuid":"c248d718-545a-4934-8560-a52bebbfc8c0"}